# Build context allowlist for BOTH images built from the repo root:
#   isicomms/Dockerfile   (gateway — needs backbone/ + isicomms/)
#   docker/Dockerfile.app (GPU app — backbone/isistream/monitor_web/isical/
#                          calibration/tools + docker/environment.app.yml)
# Everything else is excluded so the context stays tiny (the repo carries
# ~47GB under trainer/ + ~2GB under archive/ that must never enter a build).
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!backbone
!isicomms
!isistream
!monitor_web
!isical
!calibration
!tools
!docker
!config
config/*
!config/backbone.yaml.example

# Runtime/dev junk inside the allowlisted dirs — never bake.
tools/archive
calibration/.venv-multical
isical/data
isical/runs
monitor_web/.pytest_cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.ruff_cache
